# Why the Northwest Territories Is Special

The Northwest Territories offers some of the most untouched landscapes in Canada.

Travelers can:

* Watch the northern lights from some of the world's best viewing locations
* Explore Canada's largest lakes
* Visit enormous national parks
* Paddle through remote wilderness
* See bison, bears, wolves, and caribou
* Experience traditional Indigenous cultures
* Fly over breathtaking landscapes
* Discover historic northern communities
* Travel where few people have ever been

The NWT is not about crowded attractions — it is about connection with nature.

